# Financial law (owner-gated, CPA-grade)
- Anything touching `accounting.*`/`catalogs.accounts`/`db/migrations/*`/posting/GL/ledger/balances/periods/grants/RLS/money = **financial cluster**. **Builders never merge their own financial work — Devin merges on green (owner ruling 2026-07-29).** Owner Neon-apply still required for DDL. Never build finance/posting logic solo (design docs only) — **reuse the existing poster, write no new GL math**.
- **The `JORGE-APPROVED` label is NOT a merge gate and must never be treated as one** (owner rulings 2026-07-26 and 2026-07-29; `21-session-operating-decree`, `docs/specs/PRE-BLOCK-OWNER-QUESTIONS-LAW-2026-07-26.md`). The owner does not review PRs. A gate nobody operates is a control deficiency, not a control: it records an approval step that never ran, which is worse to a CPA/auditor/lender/court than having no step. Asking for the label at merge time is itself a violation.
- **The controls that actually operate, and therefore ARE the financial controls:** (1) the builder never merges its own financial work — Devin does, and Rule 11's independent reviewer must be a different agent than the builder; (2) `ih35_app` **cannot run DDL** — the database itself refuses, and the owner applies migrations on Neon; (3) money-posting flags default **OFF** per entity; (4) the 18-key evidence block on every money commit, CI-enforced at verify-steps 1324/1430/1431. These are enforced by machine or by the owner's own hand, so they leave real evidence.
- **Unanswered owner questions are settled BEFORE implementation, never at merge** (`PRE-BLOCK-OWNER-QUESTIONS-LAW`). "May we merge this PR?" is not an owner question.
- Parallel double-books; **QBO is NEVER written to** (reconcile-only, clone-once). Money-posting env flags default **OFF**, per-entity override only, until CPA sign-off + Neon tie-out.
- Standards: US GAAP / FASB ASC. Chapter 11 = **ASC 470-60 debt restructuring (NOT ASC 852 fresh-start)**. ASC 606 revenue; ASC 842 for TRK↔USMCA truck leases. Factoring = secured borrowing (recourse), not a sale.
- Cutover 04/01/2026; opening balances as-of 03/31/2026 (owner-entered only). Balanced opening JE, OBE plug.
- The Financial/Accounting Agent must pass (GL correct, debits=credits, right accounts, flags OFF, entity-scoped) before any money PR merges.
